== Thread Y2: task queries per rejection with a fallible node verifier N ==
   T = 300 problems per seed, seeds [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]; 40 insight types, Poisson(1) per problem; b = 3 lemmas per
   internal call (40 calls per tree at d = 3); human slip rate e_h per call; N's false-pass and false-fail
   rates both = f; deviated calls submit k_dev = 2 claims; r0 = 10, s = 10.
   Costs: mean (max) task queries per search.  'hit' = searches ending in a hit (at most 40 per seed);
   'rep' = searches ending in a certified human slip, then a repair of N's verdict (no bit learned).

